  "body": "Nestled in a quiet and family-friendly street, this versatile Home & Granny property presents an outstanding opportunity for homeowners, investors, and developers alike. Set on a generous 728m² freehold site, it offers comfortable living and future development possibilities.\r\nThe property provides flexible accommodation options, making it ideal for extended families, more rental ability, or those seeking additional space. With its sizeable landholding and potential for future subdivision (subject to council approval), this is a property that offers both immediate benefits and long-term value.\r\nLocated within the highly sought-after Rangitoto School Zone, families will appreciate access to some of Auckland's most desirable schools. The peaceful setting offers a relaxed lifestyle while remaining close to Browns Bay Beach, local shops, public transport, and motorway access.\r\nKey Features \r\n*\tPotential subdivision opportunity (subject to council approval) \r\n*\tZoned for Rangitoto College \r\n*\tQuiet and established neighbourhood \r\n*\tIdeal for extended family living\r\n*\tExcellent investment, landbank, or development opportunity \r\nOpportunities like this are rarely available. Secure your future in one of the North Shore's most sought-after locations.",
